Deterministic linters and scanners found 2 result(s) on the lines this merge request changes (ci:ruff 1, ci:semgrep 1). The bot publishes them itself as separate threads: do NOT report the same problems again; `submit_finding` rejects duplicates. Call `lint_findings` (optionally with a path) to see them before you report something on those lines.

