CI coverage report: 50.0% of the changed executable lines are covered (1 of 2). Call `coverage` (optionally with a path) for the uncovered lines per file.
When important new logic (branches, error handling, calculations, state changes) has no tests, report it as a finding on that code (minor; major for critical paths such as money, auth, data loss). Do not report uncovered trivial lines (logging, simple getters, wiring).

